    provided me with a solid foundation in full-stack web development, machine
    learning, and compiler design, and I have had the opportunity to work on a
    variety of projects that have allowed me to apply my knowledge in real-world
    scenarios.
  </div>
  <div>
    Outside of tech, I enjoy reading, playing video games, and sometimes
    dabbling in writing. I have a particular interest in history and fantasy
    literature, and I enjoy exploring new worlds and ideas through books and
